'''Shifters''' (previously known as '''BDS Esport''' and '''Team BDS''') is a [[:category:Switzerland|Swiss]]/[[:category:Malta|Maltese]] esports organisation based in [[wikipedia:Geneva|Geneva]].

{{GameArticle}}

==History==
The name "BDS" comes from '''B'''ailo '''D'''e '''S'''poelberch, which is the name of the team's CEO and owner, Patrice Bailo De Spoelberch. He is the heir to the [[wikipedia:House of Spoelberch|Spoelberch family]] and a major shareholder in the [[wikipedia:AB InBev|AB InBev]] brewing group.

